  title: 'Forms/ZimmSubscribeSection',
  component: ZimmSubscribeSection,
  // Isolated-mount a11y context. axe measures contrast against the nearest computed background,
  // so with no ancestor background it walked up to the white canvas and failed the *heading*
  // (--zimm-color-text-inverse-grey, #969696) at 2.95:1 against AA's 4.5:1. The body copy is
  // --zimm-color-text-inverse (#ffffff), which on white rendered invisible rather than flagged.
  // Both are artefacts of the isolated mount, not defects: the footer renders this organism
  // inside footer.css.ts's `container` part, the only ancestor that sets a background
  // (--zimm-color-bg-05, #191919). There the heading is 5.94:1 and the body copy 17.58:1.
  // This decorator reproduces that background so the check measures the shipped context.
  //
  // Deliberately not `parameters.backgrounds`: Storybook 10 reads the canvas background from
  // `globals.backgrounds.value`, not `parameters.backgrounds.default`, and its built-in `dark`
  // option is #333 — a near-miss for #191919 that would read as a second, disagreeing source
  // for the same colour.
  decorators: [
